# Colpitts-style CE with collector tank (L up, C hang to the side)
# Branches at stem centers; equal interconnects everywhere.
label FB
r (base)
pulldown{2 Res Rb 22k}
r r (qb) Q:B npn Q1 2N3904
to C
(tank)
label OUT
u u Ind L1 100n u PWR:VCC
@tank
move { u }
r r r (c1hang)
d d Cap C1 100p d d GND
@tank
move { u }
r r r r r r (c2rail)
d d Cap C2 100p d d GND
@qb
to E
d d Res Re 220 d GND
